  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I enlighet med uv&#xE4;rderingsplanen skall Sidas humanit&#xE4;ra bist&#xE5;nd utv&#xE4;rderas under 2010. Utv&#xE4;rderingen skall anv&#xE4;ndas som en input till Sidas nya strategi f&#xF6;r humanit&#xE4;rt bist&#xE5;nd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In accordance with Sida&apos;s evaluation plan it has been decided that an evaluation of Sida&apos;s humanitarian assistance will be undertaken during 2010. The evaluation will serve as an input to the revision of Sida&apos;s strategy for humanitarian assistance.</narrative>
